    "explanation": "E.T.C.'s aggressive crowd control-oriented Ability set makes him particularly useful to any Hero who is able to follow up on said crowd control with powerful damaging and/or crowd controlling Abilities.\n\nIf you pair E.T.C. with a Hero who, like him, is capable of playing as either Tank and Offlaner, you can keep E.T.C. in the 4-man until Stage Dive gets unlocked and then swap.\n\nHealers who can provide Unstoppable during Mosh Pit (such as Kharazim with Cleansing Touch) are great to deny enemy interrupts which will otherwise shut it down."
  },
